{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\nPayments & Split Tenders Ledger\nMULTI-TENDER AUDIT\n\nBreakdown of Cash, UPI Bharat QR, Card Swipe EDC, and Split-Tender reconciliations across all cashier counters.\n\nGROSS SALES RECEIVED\n₹0\nAll Payment Modes Combined\nCASH IN DRAWER\n₹0\n0% of Total Volume\nUPI / BHARAT QR\n₹0\n0% Digital QR Volume\nCARD SWIPE EDC\n₹0\nBank EDC Settlements\nUnderstanding Split Multi-Tender Payments\n\nHow JAMANVAAR POS handles split payment allocations seamlessly\n\nSmart Settlement Active\n1. FLEXIBLE ALLOCATION\n\nFor any bill (e.g. ₹756), the cashier can allocate part of the amount to Cash (e.g. ₹500) and the remaining balance to UPI QR (e.g. ₹256).\n\n2. EXACT CASH DRAWER MATH\n\nThe Cash portion is strictly recorded in the Cash Drawer Shift Ledger, preventing float discrepancies during end-of-day reconciliation.\n\n3. ITEMIZED TAX RECEIPT\n\nThe printed 80mm/58mm thermal receipt and WhatsApp e-Bill itemize the breakdown clearly: Cash: ₹500 | UPI: ₹256.\n\nCompleted Payment Transactions (0)\nReal-Time Sync\nORDER / INVOICE\tTABLE / TYPE\tCUSTOMER\tTOTAL SETTLED\tPAYMENT METHOD\tTIMESTAMP\tRECEIPT\nJAMAN AI",
